# Project Agent Environment

This `.agents/` directory belongs to the generated `{{PROJECT_NAME}}` project.
It is project-local and must not be confused with the AgentSkills repository's
own global authoring environment.

## Agents

Agent files are optional project artifacts. Define personas and handoffs only
when the project requires them; there is no universal `agent0` identity.

## Marketplace

`.agents/plugins/marketplace.json` is the project-local marketplace registry.
Keep it synchronized with the distributable `plugins/` tree.
